</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>For me He left His glorious throne above,</l><l>For me revealed His Father’s wondrous love,</l><l>For me He tabernacled here below,</l><l>For me He drank the bitter cup of woe.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>For me He was reviled, despised, betrayed;</l><l>For me was scourged, condemned and crucified;</l><l>For me He suffered on th’ accursed tree,</l><l>For me—lost, wretched, vile, unworthy me.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>For me in agony He groaned and died,</l><l>For me God’s righteous law He satisfied,</l><l>For me His precious blood He shed to save,</l><l>For me He rose triumphant from the grave.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
